DESCRIPTION:BOX OFFICE: 6:00 PM DOORS: 7:00 PM All Ages Welcome We're cashl
	ess! All points of sale will only accept credit\, debit or mobile pay (suc
	h as Apple Pay or Google Pay). Will call tickets can be picked up on day o
	f show at the Box Office. Box Office opens 1 hour prior to door times. You
	 will need a valid photo ID and the credit card used for purchase. ADA tic
	kets can be purchased online - you do not need to call the box office to p
	lace an order. Look for the logo on the Find Tickets page to view all avai
